OL,3,GNEWSAAre police dogs a dying breed?    
OL,4,ANumbers drop by a third in three years 
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,7,F(PSNI) said budget pressures have      
OL,8,Faffected its Dog Section, with fewer   
OL,9,Fhandler posts among the reasons for the
OL,10,Fdecline and dogs being retired from    
OL,11,Fduty.                                  
